as far as action-packed shows from the  1990s go xena warrior princess is one of  the best  xena played by lucy lawless was given  her own spin-off after a brief recurring  role in hercules the legendary journeys  creator robert tapert recognized how  popular she was with audiences and xena  warrior princess quickly became a cult  favorite running for six seasons from  1995 to 2001. the swords and sandals  epic doesn't just have the hero facing  off against evil warlords or ares the  god of war however xena often battles  demons and monsters too and considering  the show was produced in the 1990s some  of the practical effects looked pretty  great it seems pretty clear that xena is  ripe for a reboot especially in a time  where wonder woman made 800 million  dollars at the box office when it  debuted back in 2017.  so why hasn't a xena reboot happened yet  unsurprisingly xena fans have always  been vocal about their love for the hero  especially since many saw the clear  subtext in the show that she had a  romance with gabrielle played by renee  o'connor in fact their relationship was  going to be the main focus of a new xena  reboot in 2015 from lost alumni javier  griot marswa for nbc brio martial wrote  on his tumblr page in 2016 there is no  reason to bring back xena if it is not  there for the purpose of fully exploring  a relationship that could only be shown  subtextually in first run syndication in  the 1990s he also noted that the reboot  would have some kind of social relevance  in its story saying  it will also express my view of the  world which is only further informed by  what is happening right now  unfortunately in 2017 grio marswa parted  ways with the xena reboot due to  creative differences with nbc  however grio marswa told the mary sue  that he remains hopeful xena will return  to the screen at some point in the  future explaining i truly hope that the  alchemy of creative elements that has to  come together to make possible either a  reboot or revival of this amazing  property will someday coalesce  when the news broke that the xena reboot  wasn't going forward at nbc the  network's former entertainment president  jennifer salke explained to the  hollywood reporter nothing is happening  on that right now we looked at some  material we decided at that point that  it didn't warrant a reboot however it  wasn't all negative as selkie pointed  out that xena is a beloved property that  might be rebooted someday it all depends  on who's at the helm of the reboot as  sulky explained i'd never say never on  that one because it's such a beloved  title but the current incarnation of it  is dead i need someone to come in with a  point of view about what they want to do  in 2018 the pilot script for the reboot  leaked online to the xena movie campaign  facebook page but fans in the comments  were disappointed about what the script  contained  for instance one user lamented that  hercules had been changed into a  heartless mercenary in the script others  felt that it had potential especially  where xena and gabrielle's relationship  was concerned  fans also pointed out that a new xena  project without lucy lawless wouldn't  feel right as for whether the star would  ever come back to the role the answer is  yes and we all have terminator dark fate  to thank lawless told yahoo  entertainment in july 2019 that seeing  linda hamilton return as sarah connor  made her wonder why she couldn't do the  same with xena she revealed i saw linda  being amazing and i'm like why can't we  do that bring back me and renee o'connor  and reboot xena while lawless did admit  that filming all the action wasn't her  favorite part of making xena warrior  princess she said she'd happily do it  for a big screen project explaining i  always hated the action and i don't want  to live that life but for a movie i can  do a little bit lawless even suggested  that a cinematic outing for xena could  easily set up a brand new hero  explaining if it's about handing over  the baton to junior xena or whatever if  you need mine and renee's help to do  that let's talk lucy lawless is in and  so are the fans nbc just needs to find a  writer with a new vision  sounds simple enough check out one of  our newest videos right here plus even  more looper videos about your favorite  tv shows are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

